Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: wlroots scene API with blur, shadows and rounded corners
 SceneFX replaces wlroots' scene renderer with one that can draw blur,
 shadows, rounded corners and opacity. MangoWC is built on it.

